OA2F2vVvlKBQx0G0TdsbNIdURWWhrg&oe=6A451FF2"}, {"file_name": "ss2.png", "id": "296114026862324", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_296114030195657_275861733805151497_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0UeDI6qOCD8Q7kNvwGYmxjj&_nc_oc=AdpG6KpkgK2Q91MgG-dHKFgPYKrpxZTJFUSbR2oNhv32LQd5ncCp31BCaufCK4EPxPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-_W7ZA8Dmgj45o2IzggoSy57LFYd6NSzddDSrIQahp1w&oe=6A452B21"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "802537541948419", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210889_802537548615085_7583608226087987807_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hbvZ37G_dLQQ7kNvwE24t31&_nc_oc=Adp_pyswd4wf7z0IWuSFn85jd7X69bO7RJzhxJHbjvkXvvtX0052x_WyMK2f7OZa2EM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8MfeIwA2HPy_NieYFWZJAwdtHtDhm-dw88LdA7cEN3aw&oe=6A4520EE"}, {"file_name": "ss3.png", "id": "1952004381931095", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75298472_1952004385264428_8213665801664121384_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GYLEKyk1zJwQ7kNvwE_mwtx&_nc_oc=AdpXKzUBxA6fDlI7pLRhOj_MMWUNFZ1Fa2M6v3QiZS-1jZ6vr7RKRdycJVecidj9BK8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-d_NJX7_GO70P7tHwMqKYKI1DDgeGqiw_vLS16UuZtXA&oe=6A4506AC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "7841830009239208", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035410_7841830012572541_6800934679758716826_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MLKpvEVLyUQQ7kNvwHTvR0l&_nc_oc=AdptWU2es1n-7r2ZkenO9bPtAkkXRU0w4V6n2Ev7kF1eq__I3JE9Sq8qTh4sEbr1dPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-R5Q4Q1MI0Yd-csR-_kK2Nj1K8DrLtSUK3PwxSTznipQ&oe=6A453313"}, "display_name": "Orb Conquest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Orb Conquest: The Ultimate VR Experience\n\nDive into the exhilarating world of \"Orb Conquest,\" a cutting-edge VR game that challenges your precision, reflexes, and strategic thinking. Set in a futuristic realm where you control dynamic spheres, your mission is to navigate these spheres through intricate tracks and lines, overcoming a series of increasingly complex obstacles and challenges.\nGameplay Overview\n\nIn \"Orb Conquest,\" players are transported to a visually stunning, high-tech environment filled with neon-lit paths and mesmerizing graphics. The game mechanics are designed to test and enhance your coordination and problem-solving skills. Each level presents a unique maze-like track, teeming with hurdles that require quick thinking and precise movements to overcome.\nKey Features\n\n    Dynamic Spheres: Master the control of highly responsive spheres, each with unique attributes and abilities that you can unlock and upgrade as you progress.\n\n    Intricate Tracks: Navigate through a variety of complex and beautifully designed tracks. Each track offers different challenges, from narrow passages to moving barriers and beyond.", "short_description": "Orb Conquest: The Ultimate VR Experience\n\nDive into the exhilarating world of \"Orb Conquest,\" a cutting-edge VR game that challenges your precision, reflexes, and strategic thinking. Set in a futuristic realm where you control dynamic spheres, your mission is to navigate these spheres through intricate tracks and lines, overcoming a series of increasingly complex obstacles and challenges."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/orbconquest/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SGag2426 Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/orbconquest", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type":